{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"goblin_wolf","model_identifier":"goblin_wolf","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# goblin_wolf\n\nGoblin wolf (C4), mount, 1.0 m (34 u) at the shoulder, about 1.8 m (64 u) nose to rump plus tail.\n\nA large rangy grey wolf with a shaggy shoulder ruff, pale belly and muzzle, black-rimmed yellow eyes, and a goblin saddle of leather with bone pommel and cantle, bone-studded flaps and a rope girth. Quadruped rig: root > body > rear, neck > head > jaw, tail_1 > tail_2, legs leg_upper/leg_lower/paw for front_r/front_l/hind_r/hind_l. `slot_rider` on the seat (child of body, so it follows the gait): parent goblin_wolf_rider's root to it; the seated goblin's feet hang at the wolf's elbows (the bottom of the chest, y ~ 20).\n\n- Cubes: 32 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -7.5..7.5, y 0.0..42.5, z -39.5..37.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 14 x 36 x 62 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = -4, from y = 0 (rider adds ~30 u of height)\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 2.6 | loop |  |\n| `walk` | 0.85 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.42 | loop |  |\n| `charge` | 0.42 | loop | head and neck lowered, flat-out gallop (loop) |\n| `attack_bite` | 1.1 | once | key 0.48 s: jaws snap shut after a crouch (0.22) and lunge (0.4) |\n| `aggro` | 1.2 | once | head low, snarling |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | yelping flinch |\n| `death` | 1.5 | hold | legs give, rolls onto its right side, holds; rests on y = 0 (play the rider's death at the same time) |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 56.9 u/s (1.60 m/s), cycle 0.85 s, 48.4 u per cycle\n- `run`: 248.9 u/s (7.00 m/s), cycle 0.42 s, 104.5 u per cycle (rotary gallop)\n- `charge`: 302.2 u/s (8.50 m/s), cycle 0.42 s, 126.9 u per cycle (head low, ears flat)\n\n## Key times\n\n- `attack_bite`: key 0.48 s: jaws snap shut after a crouch (0.22) and lunge (0.4)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_rider` on `body` at (0, 35.5, -3)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `slot_rider`: the saddle seat, y = 35.5, z = -3\n\n## Notes\n\n- glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l are the lit cubes.\n- Variant textures: goblin_wolf_dark.png, goblin_wolf_pale.png.\n"},"description":"# goblin_wolf\n\nGoblin wolf (C4), mount, 1.0 m (34 u) at the shoulder, about 1.8 m (64 u) nose to rump plus tail.\n\nA large rangy grey wolf with a shaggy shoulder ruff, pale belly and muzzle, black-rimmed yellow eyes, and a goblin saddle of leather with bone pommel and cantle, bone-studded flaps and a rope girth. Quadruped rig: root > body > rear, neck > head > jaw, tail_1 > tail_2, legs leg_upper/leg_lower/paw for front_r/front_l/hind_r/hind_l. `slot_rider` on the seat (child of body, so it follows the gait): parent goblin_wolf_rider's root to it; the seated goblin's feet hang at the wolf's elbows (the bottom of the chest, y ~ 20).\n\n- Cubes: 32 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -7.5..7.5, y 0.0..42.5, z -39.5..37.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 14 x 36 x 62 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = -4, from y = 0 (rider adds ~30 u of height)\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 2.6 | loop |  |\n| `walk` | 0.85 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.42 | loop |  |\n| `charge` | 0.42 | loop | head and neck lowered, flat-out gallop (loop) |\n| `attack_bite` | 1.1 | once | key 0.48 s: jaws snap shut after a crouch (0.22) and lunge (0.4) |\n| `aggro` | 1.2 | once | head low, snarling |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | yelping flinch |\n| `death` | 1.5 | hold | legs give, rolls onto its right side, holds; rests on y = 0 (play the rider's death at the same time) |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 56.9 u/s (1.60 m/s), cycle 0.85 s, 48.4 u per cycle\n- `run`: 248.9 u/s (7.00 m/s), cycle 0.42 s, 104.5 u per cycle (rotary gallop)\n- `charge`: 302.2 u/s (8.50 m/s), cycle 0.42 s, 126.9 u per cycle (head low, ears flat)\n\n## Key times\n\n- `attack_bite`: key 0.48 s: jaws snap shut after a crouch (0.22) and lunge (0.4)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_rider` on `body` at (0, 35.5, -3)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `slot_rider`: the saddle seat, y = 35.5, z = -3\n\n## Notes\n\n- glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l are the lit cubes.\n- Variant textures: goblin_wolf_dark.png, goblin_wolf_pale.png.\n","resolution":{"width":128,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"chest","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-6.0,20.0,-21.0],"to":[6.0,34.0,2.1],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,27.0,-4.2],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[63,24,75.0,38.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[15,24,38.1,38.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[75,24,87.0,38.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[39,24,62.1,38.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,0,12.0,23.1],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[12,0,24.0,23.1],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"adf7ca24-6d2f-504a-b31c-b6a445cda930"},{"name":"waist","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-5.0,22.0,2.1],"to":[5.0,33.5,21.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,27.0,2.1],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[66,39,76.0,50.5],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[28,39,46.9,50.5],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[76,39,86.0,50.5],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[47,39,65.9,50.5],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[24,0,34.0,18.9],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[34,0,44.0,18.9],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"bcb00943-24e1-5f56-90bb-13b4136b9d7c"},{"name":"neck","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_orde